{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 80,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.3832015991211,
        57.98431396484375,
        383.16009521484375,
        84.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "9. Evidence for recommendation",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.9541015625,
        79.98431396484375,
        352.5680847167969,
        106.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "on use of antibiotics in SAM",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.5670166015625,
        379.4440612792969,
        203.75601196289062
      ],
      "text": "9.1\t Antibiotics use in the management of severe acute malnutrition",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.19261169433594,
        399.02294921875,
        220.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "a)\t In children with severe acute malnutrition (SAM) without complications, manage",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        220.19261169433594,
        336.3314208984375,
        233.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "according to the current community case management guidelines.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        235.5972900390625,
        228.1529083251953,
        249.51730346679688
      ],
      "text": "(Weak Recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.8618927001953,
        399.1228332519531,
        265.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIn children with severe acute malnutrition with complications, give parenteral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        264.86187744140625,
        156.61154174804688,
        278.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics as follows:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        277.86187744140625,
        399.1213073730469,
        291.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "—\t Benzyl penicillin: 50 000 U/kg IM/IV every 6 hours, or ampicillin 50 mg/kg",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        290.86187744140625,
        399.18463134765625,
        304.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "IM/IV every 6 hours for 2 days, then oral amoxicillin: 15 mg/kg/dose every",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        303.86187744140625,
        156.78469848632812,
        317.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "8 hours for 5 days)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        316.86187744140625,
        90.1614990234375,
        330.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "AND",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        329.86187744140625,
        291.6715393066406,
        343.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "—\t Gentamicin: 7.5 mg/kg IM/IV once daily for 7 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.2665100097656,
        249.51284790039062,
        359.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        361.53118896484375,
        399.06298828125,
        375.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation was based on the current WHO definition of complicated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        374.53118896484375,
        399.03289794921875,
        388.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "Severe Acute Malnutrition (SAM). The panel emphasized that where a child with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        387.53118896484375,
        399.05291748046875,
        401.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "SAM has complications of very severe pneumonia or meningitis, treatment should",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        400.53118896484375,
        280.512939453125,
        414.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "be based on the specific guidelines for these conditions.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        413.53118896484375,
        399.0213317871094,
        427.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "The panel had concern that the recommendation to give antibiotic to all children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        426.53118896484375,
        399.0428466796875,
        440.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "with SAM, even those with no complications, would apply to a substantial number of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        439.53118896484375,
        399.1127624511719,
        453.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "children in the Indian subcontinent. It was observed that there should be a distinction",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.53118896484375,
        399.0628967285156,
        466.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "between the acute form of SAM, which is common in Africa and chronic SAM, which",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        465.53118896484375,
        399.04296875,
        479.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "is common in Asia. The panel made a decision not to make a recommendation to give",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        478.53118896484375,
        399.10302734375,
        492.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics in SAM with no complications, but to follow community case management",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        491.53118896484375,
        194.8028564453125,
        505.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for consistency.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        516.0497436523438,
        233.98292541503906,
        528.039794921875
      ],
      "text": "9.1.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        531.7044067382812,
        399.09283447265625,
        545.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review [Lazzerini, 2010] identified three studies of antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        544.7044067382812,
        399.06280517578125,
        558.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness in treating children with SAM. The use of broad-spectrum antibiotics in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        557.7044067382812,
        399.0929260253906,
        571.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "children hospitalized with SAM is supported by strong epidemiological data and low",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        570.7044067382812,
        399.0727844238281,
        584.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "quality clinical studies. However, there is insufficient data from RCTs to determine",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        583.7044067382812,
        399.16290283203125,
        597.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "the most effective antibiotic regimen. The role of antibiotics in home treatment of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        596.7044067382812,
        399.11285400390625,
        610.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "‘uncomplicated’ malnutrition is not clear, and there is very low quality evidence that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        245.90289306640625,
        609.4844360351562,
        343.3128662109375,
        623.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.27",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        609.7044067382812,
        348.7318115234375,
        623.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics may not be of benefit in this group ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.37550354003906,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6645050048828,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "66",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}